  "step_3": "The decision reason requires consideration of differences between outcomes and a reference value (500 in this case), and a calculation of the weighted mean of those differences. The individual in the verbal report does not mention such differences or any calculation involving deviations from 500. Instead, the individual focuses solely on the certainty of the gain (sicherer Geldgewinn), which is a different reasoning path. While the individual’s choice aligns with a risk-averse preference, the specific rule of the decision reason — comparing mean differences from a reference value — is not present in the reported deliberation. Therefore, the individual did not use the specified decision reason. The justification in the report is based on certainty, not on differences from a reference value or their probabilistic mean. Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
